{
  "id": "1CO.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Abakorinto 9",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omotomwa ore omogwekano omuya ase ogotarigia ebimotungetie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Inche tindi omosibore? Inche tindi omotomwa? Tinaroche Yeso, Omonene oito? Inwe timori okwama kw’emeremo yane ase Omonene?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki onye inche tindi omotomwa ase abande, korende nomotomwa inde ase more inwe. Inwe nigo more ekemanyererio ki’obotomwa bwane ase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oko nakwo okoiraneria kwane ase baria bakomboria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Titori ne ribaga ri’okoria na konywa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Titori ne ribaga koira amo naintwe omokungu ore oyominto ase okwegena buna abatomwa bande, na abamwabo Omonene, na Kefa bakorete?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose ninche bweka na Barnaba totari ne ribaga ri’ogotiga emeremo ya kera rituko?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morwani ki okogenda ase esegi kero kende gionsi na kweakanera ere omonyene? Moremi ki otakoria amasabibu ’omogondo oye bw’emesabibu? Gose ning’o okorisia riicho, otakonywa amabeere aye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Nigo ngokwana aya buna Mwanyabaanto? Gose amachiiko tari goteeba boigo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki ase amachiiko a Musa nigo ariikire, “Tobaisa kobekera entang’ana ekeokio ekero ekoora endagera.” Inee! Nyasae narengereretie amang’ana e chintang’ana?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Tateebete ayio ase engencho yaito yoka? Ee, nigo ariikire ase engencho yaito; ekiagera oyokorema nagwenerete korema ase ogosemeria, na ere oyokoora nigo akoora ase ogosemeria konyora ensemo yaye y’endagera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye intwe twabasimekeire ebinto bi’omoika, Inee, nering’ana rinene gatoragese ebinto biaino bi’ogokonya ase obogima bw’ense eye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye abande banyorire ensemo ebatungetie korwa ase more, Inee, intwe titokoyenyora kobua mono?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Korende titorakorera oboronge obo; korende nigo tokoremereria amang’ana onsi, titobaisa gotanga enchiri ya Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timomanyeti ng’a baria bagokora emeremo ase Hekalu nigo bakoria endagera korwa ase Hekalu, na baria bagokorera ase egesasiimero mbare nensemo yabo ase ebinto bikoruegwa ebing’wanso?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Omonene naboigo ochikiire ng’a baria bakorandia enchiri banyore ebibagwenerete korwa ase enchiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende tindakorera amang’ana aya nonya ndimo. Gose tinyarigeti aya erinde abe boigo ase ’nde; naki mbuya ninkwa kobua omonto onde bwensi kong’ura ogwetogia kwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki onye nkorandia enchiri, tindi neri ingwetogeria, ekiagera okobetererigwa kwabekirwe ase ’nde. Obobe nobwane ntarandeti enchiri!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki onye ngokora emeremo eye ase ogwancha kwane, ninde neng’eria; korende onye tari ase ogwancha kwane, nonya nabo negenirwe noborendi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki eng’eria yane ninki? Neye, ng’a ndandie enchiri ya Kristo ntari konyora ebintungetie, na tinsaba ebiaboronge biane ase okorandia enchiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omokia o Paulo bw’okorenta abanto ase Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki nonya inde nobosibore korwa ase abanto bonsi, nekorire omosomba o bonsi, erinde ndete abanto abange kobua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase Abayahudi nkaba buna Omoyahudi, erinde mbarente Abayahudi; ase baria bare inse y’amachiiko nkaba buna oyore inse y’amachiiko (nonya inche omonyene tindi inse y’amachiiko) erinde mbarente baria bare inse y’amachiiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase baria batari namachiiko nkaba buna oyo otari namachiiko (tari buna tindi namachiiko ase obosio bwa Nyasae, korende nigo inde inse y’amachiiko a Kristo) erinde mbarente baria batari namachiiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase abare abareu nkaba omoreu, erinde mbarente abareu. Igo nkaba n’echingencho chionsi ase abanto bonsi, erinde inyare kobatooria abanto ase chinchera chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inche nigo ngokora aya onsi ase engencho y’enchiri, erinde inyare koba oyomo obo bw’abakonyora ogosesenigwa kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omokia ogwenerete ase obobui",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timomanyeti ng’a abwo bakoamererania ase okominyoka chimbero, nigo bakominyoka bonsi, korende noyomo bweka okonyora eng’eria? Minyoka boigo, erinde moyenyore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kera oyokoamererania ase chigosori nigo agwetanga ase onsi. Na abwo nigo bagokora bo, erinde banyore egutwa egosareka, korende intwe tonyore eye etagosareka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya ninche nkominyoka nde chimbero ntari gotiting’ara; naboigo inkorwanera chinkundi, tari buna oyokorwana nembeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nigo ngochanda omobere one na koyokoria buna omosomba, erinde konarandeirie abande, inche timba omonto ogocha kwangwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "1CO.10",
